N:UNCERTAIN: where the bars begin (written from the first clear C minor chord); the C major chords in the first section (C and G sound, the E natural is weak); D flat or F minor at 16.9-18.5 s; D minor or B flat over D at 11.3 s and 24.1 s; the voicings, which are written plainly here, not as the bells sounded.
